{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NhRybxgW6g1792968180.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>將於本周二掛牌的東山精密，每股招股價定價86.8元，較最高招股價93.8元低百分之7.4，相當於集資額由最高超過106億元，至只有不足99億元。</p><p></p><p>PCB印刷電路板生產商東山精密，發售量調整權亦未獲行使，即表示公司不會超額發售股份。公司原計劃發售逾1.13億股H股，若市場反應佳可額外發售1,700多萬股H股。</p><p></p><p>公司現於深圳交易所上市，股價較今年六月高位已回落近六成，但本年至今仍錄得三成半漲幅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:46.671656+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:16.613296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:10.725276+00:00","content_hash":"a872dbba0d51572b83437e65bf0c31076d3120746b7f6a8a7783805bca304b44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:46.671656+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}